--- !u!102 &259560787
TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 259560785}
  m_Text: 'These are regular TouchStills. Now

    instead of changing effector settings,

    select
    objects and move them around.


    When object enters user''s sphere trigger,

    effector
    Update() loop checks it''s targets

    with each effector to match.


    When
    matched (e.g. LeftHand effector to

    Left Hand target), it starts to check
    for

    position and angles with effector settings.

    If check is positive,
    starts interaction by

    sending a call to IK.'
  m_OffsetZ: 0
  m_CharacterSize: 6
  m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Anchor: 7
  m_Alignment: 1
  m_TabSize: 4
  m_FontSize: 75
  m_FontStyle: 0
  m_RichText: 1
  m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 436664d726292a54fa79d2168f4541ac, type: 3}
  m_Color:
    serializedVersion: 2
    rgba: 4294967295
