  m_Text: "Select ProtoMan, open Interactor\r\ncomponent and enable Debug option.\r\nYou'll
    see all effectors in both Editor\r\nand runtime on SceneView, \r\neven if Interactor
    object is not selected. \r\n\r\nYou can change effector settings on\r\nInteractor
    component or using SceneView\n\rhandles directly by dragging them.\n\r\nAlso
    if you open InteractorTargetSpawner \nwindow\r by clicking the Spawner button\n
    on\r Interactor component, it will enable\r\nSceneView toggle button on top."
