--- !u!102 &466802021
TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 466802019}
  m_Text: "DistanceRange\r\n\r\nThis is mostly used by doors. When \r\nthe player
    is within the set range, the \r\ndoor will trigger its events without \r\nneeding
    an InteractorTarget.\r\n\r\nIn addition to range, the door also \r\nchecks if
    there are any obstacles \r\nbetween the player and the door. \r\n\r\nThis ensures
    that doors on different \r\nfloors (above or below the player) \r\ndon't activate."
  m_OffsetZ: 0
  m_CharacterSize: 6
  m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Anchor: 4
  m_Alignment: 1
  m_TabSize: 4
  m_FontSize: 75
  m_FontStyle: 0
  m_RichText: 1
