--- !u!102 &779537194
TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 779537192}
  m_Text: "Creating Restrictions\r\n\r\nEffector rules on Interactor help set restrictions
    but do not fix all situations. \nNot all interactable objects are the same and
    not all of them have the same placements.\r\n\r\nGo to Button No 01, stand on
    the arrow in the same direction and interact with it. \nProtoMan will be able
    to interact behind the button box, which is undesirable. \nThere are a few methods
    to prevent that.\r\n\r\nGo to #02 and try the same. And it won't allow interacting
    from different locations other \nthan front because it has Obstacle setting enabled.
    It shots a ray when checking effector rules \nfor the target. And if there is
    an obstacle, it won't allow interaction."
  m_OffsetZ: 0
  m_CharacterSize: 6
  m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Anchor: 1
  m_Alignment: 1
  m_TabSize: 4
  m_FontSize: 75
  m_FontStyle: 0
