  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1766198239}
  m_Text: "InteractorObject is located on the backAxe.\r\nWhen used, it triggers
    its InteractorObject\r\nevent that switches controllers, \r\ndisabling the player
    controller \r\nand enabling the vehicle controller, \r\nor vice versa when the
    interaction ends."
