  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1951748638}
  m_Text: "All triggered interactions will show up \non your top left corner. Select
    any of\nthem and if that object's target or targets\nare in good position, interaction
    will start.\n\n\nIf you select \"ALL Objects\", all targets\n(if in possible
    positions) will start interaction.\n\"ALL\" selection works for just\nManuelButtons
    at the moment."
